Adopted from JENDL-5 with minor fixes by C. Mattoon               7326 1451
Fixes:                                                            7326 1451
 - Trimmed trailing zero-probability points from outgoing         7326 1451
   energy distributions.                                          7326 1451
 - Recomputed summed cross sections for MT=103, 106, 107 to agree 7326 1451
   with sum of components.                                        7326 1451
 - Added points to MT=57 cross section near threshold to agree    7326 1451
   with MT=4. MT=57 becomes the main contributor to inelastic     7326 1451
   scattering near 110 keV.                                       7326 1451
 - Modified continuum photon distributions near threshold for     7326 1451
   improved energy balance.                                       7326 1451
 - ENDF-6 data reformatted with FUDGE                             7326 1451
                                                                  7326 1451
                                                                  7326 1451
History                                                           7326 1451
2014-10 Evaluated with CCONE code by K.Shibata (JAEA)  /1/        7326 1451
2018-07 Activation cross sections and MF=3,6/MT=600-849 added.    7326 1451
2020-10 Energies of discrete primary photons were corrected.      7326 1451
