MF= 2 Resonance parameters                                        7326 1451
  MT=151 Resolved and unresolved resonance parameters             7326 1451
    Resolved resonance region: 1.0e-5 eV - 103.0 eV               7326 1451
      The parameters were taken from the work of Harvey et al./2/ 7326 1451
      The parameters for the lowest resonance were the same as    7326 1451
      those for JEFF-3.2.                                         7326 1451
                                                                  7326 1451
    Unresolved resonance region: 103.0 eV - 100 keV               7326 1451
      The parameters were obtained by fitting to the total and    7326 1451
      caputure cross sections calculated from CCONE /3/.  The     7326 1451
      unresolved parameters should be used only for self-shielding7326 1451
      calculation.                                                7326 1451
                                                                  7326 1451
